  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし}). Takes を to mark the object being operated or manipulated.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{操|あやつ}っている describes an ongoing action or habitual ability (e.g., is manipulating; can handle).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {言葉|ことば}を{操|あやつ}る: to wield language, to be fluent\n- {人形|にんぎょう}を{操|あやつ}る: to work a puppet\n- {裏|うら}で{操|あやつ}る: to manipulate from behind the scenes\n- {世論|よろん}を{操|あやつ}る: to manipulate public opinion\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {操作|そうさ}する: to operate (neutral, technical)\n- コントロールする: to control (neutral)\n- {操|あやつ}る: implies skill (sense 1) or deviousness (sense 2)",
